### RQ7: roteiro do ms-ingest (Fase 2). Use com a pilha de pé (./run.sh).
@host = http://localhost:8081

### Lote válido (202). Repetir com a mesma Idempotency-Key devolve 200 e o mesmo batch_id.
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-1

{"photos":[
  {"source_url":"https://picsum.photos/id/10/1200/800"},
  {"source_url":"https://picsum.photos/id/20/1200/800"},
  {"source_url":"https://picsum.photos/id/30/1200/800"}
]}

### Mesma chave, corpo diferente (422 idempotency_key_reuse)
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-1

{"photos":[{"source_url":"https://picsum.photos/id/99/1200/800"}]}

### Host fora da allowlist (400 invalid_request, nada é gravado)
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{"photos":[{"source_url":"https://example.com/foto.jpg"}]}

### Lista vazia (400)
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json

{"photos":[]}

### Não é JSON (415)
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: text/plain

oi

### Prontidão (503 com o broker ou o Postgres parados)
GET {{host}}/readyz
